{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenDyson-Arch/rusty-tiles/pulls/154","id":4812766469,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUWFMPs8AAAABHtz9BQ","html_url":"https://github.com/BenDyson-Arch/rusty-tiles/pull/154","diff_url":"https://github.com/BenDyson-Arch/rusty-tiles/pull/154.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BenDyson-Arch/rusty-tiles/pull/154.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenDyson-Arch/rusty-tiles/issues/154","number":154,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Replace vector compression with a bounded codec and captured-file publication","user":{"login":"BenDyson-Arch","id":186567556,"node_id":"U_kgDOCx7LhA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186567556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch","html_url":"https://github.com/BenDyson-Arch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Vector compression previously mixed path publication with codec decisions and could emit metadata framing with four undeclared BIN bytes. This replaces that path with a private physical-view codec, finite requested-storage limits and a captured-file Rust operation using F0 Replace. The real producer resolves encoding once for fitting and emission; selected eight-byte metadata framing now declares its padded extent while preserving logical view windows. Shared C1 number/meshopt owners retain typed failures.\n\nThe standalone operation preserves checked raw JSON values and physical view bytes, rechecks captured identity and bytes before replacement, preserves ordinary Unix permissions and returns post-commit cleanup diagnostics. The public Rust request has nine finite caps; the hidden CLI adapter emits its prepared report. The producer's uncompressed byte metric deliberately measures the selected raw bridge after requested quantization, including fill, with an explicit report scope.\n\nLocal validation on production pin `a6789f6fe8fdefb01049b6cb10b031970852595d48fc56c75599f776f06819c9`:\n\n- Portable all-target tests, native release tests, isolated working-directory controls, portable/native all-target release Clippy and formatting pass.\n- Independent standalone corpus: 118 cases, including 47 typed refusals; public API probe: 40 attempts covering all nine equal/one-below cap pairs and control reuse.\n- Eight actual portable/native producer pairs: sixteen archives, 76 payloads, 132 decoded streams, eight address comparisons and 22 byte-metric facts; all sixteen pass retained C1 inspection with its semantic exclusions preserved.\n- Fresh independent final local source/evidence review passed; its decision and exact reviewed tree/package pins are retained under `bench/architecture_audit/vector_compression/precode_review/final-local-implementation-20261011/`.\n- Lossless selected source/preparation/failure/actual evidence is indexed under `bench/architecture_audit/vector_compression/candidate_evidence/local-implementation-20261011/`. Compiled artifacts remain externally hash-bound. Exact-head platform/wheel/official Blender evidence and final remote review still govern merge readiness.\n\nRequested-storage estimates exclude allocator overhead, RSS and producer geometry construction. Coordinate-error bounds, triangle union, rendering and complete glTF semantic validity are separate gates. This advances #113/#126 without closing them; #121/#125 and full A2 remain open. No release promotion, tag or publication is included.\n","created_at":"2026-10-10T16:34:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T16:56:57Z","closed_at":"2026-10-10T16:56:54Z","merged_at":"2026-10-10T16:56:54Z","merge_commit_sha":"6c5ea2acac9fc403bfabfa9581464223b52259d7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenDyson-Arch/rusty-tiles/pulls/154/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenDyson-Arch/rusty-tiles/pulls/154/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenDyson-Arch/rusty-tiles/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenDyson-Arch/rusty-tiles/issues/154/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenDyson-Arch/rusty-tiles/statuses/e9fb073184ad25a1f5c7839ea5d1cd9e02830887","head":{"label":"BenDyson-Arch:feat/vector-codec-foundation","ref":"feat/vector-codec-foundation","sha":"e9fb073184ad25a1f5c7839ea5d1cd9e02830887","user":{"login":"BenDyson-Arch","id":186567556,"node_id":"U_kgDOCx7LhA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186567556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch","html_url":"https://github.com/BenDyson-Arch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenDyson-Arch/rec